MIMIC changes to Melee Unlocked (Linux native host + game shim):
  --replay / --replay-dump: Slippi replay playback for fidelity checks (tools/sim_replay_check.py)
  --env-template / --env-fds / --env-seed / --env-online-rng: live-match RL env mode (rlvr/sim/melee_sim.py)
  --no-audio / --no-render: skip audio mixing / the render pass (speed; see melee_sim.py)

Applies to Hero88go/melee-unlocked at the commit in tools/patches/melee-unlocked-commit.txt.
Partly ported from that project's port/app/source_host.cpp, so this patch is a derived work of
Melee Unlocked and is licensed GPL-3.0-or-later (see that project's LICENSE). It contains no
decompiled game code. Applied by tools/build_native_sim.sh.

